otra vez nuestros antiguos contratos.

382
00:30:43,778 --> 00:30:45,012
Siéntate.

383
00:30:45,046 --> 00:30:46,413
Oh, gracias.

384
00:30:46,447 --> 00:30:50,050
Eso es.... Dios, es...

385
00:30:51,419 --> 00:30:52,952
