Vamos.
No.

476
00:40:41,985 --> 00:40:43,151
Bien.

477
00:40:58,401 --> 00:41:02,037
Gustavo.

478
00:43:10,537 --> 00:43:11,704
   

479
00:43:19,948 --> 00:43:21,415
Señor.

